  .job-card
        h3 🍗🛵Rocket Now Food delivery⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️
        p This is a hot new food delivery service that has just arrived in Japan. After receiving an order from a customer, you head to the restaurant, pick up the items, and deliver them to the customer's home.
        .red Normally, foreign nationals cannot work for Rocket Now, but only when applying through our company, you can specially work for them.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong 
            | Unit Price:
         .col-sm-6
            | ¥500 per item (standard rate: 4 deliveries per hour)
            br/
            | For bicycle deliveries, the unit rate is ¥425 per item.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Rewards:
         .col-sm-6
          .red 
           |Days 1-3: 500 yen * 2.5 items/hr * 9h = 11,250 yen
          .red 
           |Days 4-7: 500 yen * 3 items/hr * 9h = 13,500 yen (Monthly 337,500)
          .red 
           |Day 7 onwards: 500 yen * 4 items/hr * 9h = 18,000 yen (Monthly 450,000)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Working Hours:
         .col-sm-6
          | A 11:00~16:00 / B 17:00~21:00
          br/
          | *Possible to work only A or only B
        .row
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Normal Working Days:
         .col-sm-6
          | 25 days per month
          br/
          | *Part-time work is also possible.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Contract Type:
         .col-sm-6
           | Outsourcing contract (Gyomu Itaku)
           br/
           | No social insurance.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Location:
         .col-sm-6
          | Tokyo, Kanagawa, Chiba, Saitama, Nagoya, Osaka, Kyoto, Kobe, Fukuoka, Sendai, Sapporo
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Eligible Visas:
           | Permanent Resident, Long-term Resident, Spouse Visa (and other unrestricted visas)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Vehicle & Gasoline:
         .col-sm-6
          | Rental of motorized scooters (Bicycle work negotiable)
          br/
          .red 3,000 yen gasoline subsidy for full-time work
          | *Bicycle work is possible, but the unit price will be lower.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Japanese Level:
         .col-sm-6
          | OK if you can communicate normally (No reading/writing required)
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Others:
         .col-sm-6
           | ・Scooter fees and miscellaneous expenses will be deducted from pay.
           br/
           | ・In regional areas, unit price or delivery volume may be lower than stated.
           br/
           | ・You can work outside 11:00~16:00 / 17:00~21:00, but the reward will be 400 yen.
        .row 
         .col-sm-6
           strong  
            | Caution:
         .col-sm-6
           | ・Salary reductions occur for misdeliveries, order refusals during hours, absence from location, or shift absences.
           br/
           | ・If rules are violated, shifts will be canceled and vehicle subsidies will be stopped.
           br/
           | ・The base is 4 deliveries per hour, but volume is lower in regional areas.
           br
           | ・Working outside 11:00~16:00 / 17:00~21:00 is possible, but the reward is 400 yen.
           br/
           | ・Bicycle work is possible, but reward conditions differ.
 
